  "An Information Technology student majoring in Web Development, specializing in full-stack web development, IT infrastructure support, and DevOps automation. I enjoy creating systems that solve real-world problems and am eager to connect with professionals and peers to collaborate, learn, and expand my network.": "Isang Information Technology student na nagme-major sa Web Development, nagpapakadalubhasa sa full-stack web development, IT infrastructure support, at DevOps automation. Gusto kong lumikha ng mga system na lumulutas ng totoong problema, at sabik akong makipag-ugnayan sa mga propesyonal at kapwa estudyante para makipagtulungan, matuto, at palawakin ang aking network.",
