  "Specialization": "Espesyalisasyon",
  "I started as a student with barely any knowledge in my freshman year due to not being on a specialized strand focusing on programming. I started off as clueless like everyone else in programming, especially once it reaches multiple pages. There was even a time that I refused to acknowledge using multiple files due to its complexity. However, I persevered to study everything and participated in coding competitions. Here I am today, being able to handle complex projects.": "Nagsimula ako bilang estudyanteng halos walang alam noong unang taon ko dahil hindi ako nanggaling sa strand na nakatuon sa programming. Tulad ng iba, wala akong kaalam-alam sa programming noong una, lalo na kapag umaabot na sa maraming pahina. Dumating pa nga ang panahong ayaw kong gumamit ng maraming file dahil sa pagiging komplikado nito. Gayunpaman, nagtiyaga akong pag-aralan ang lahat at sumali sa mga coding competition. Narito na ako ngayon, kaya nang humawak ng mga komplikadong proyekto.",
  "I use HTML and CSS to build dynamic, user-friendly, and responsive interfaces, and JavaScript to bring them to life with interactive features. I'm well-versed in Python and Java for data science and logic-heavy programs. I also work with Node.js, React, Angular, Vue.js, Figma, and WordPress. On the infrastructure side, I handle hardware diagnostics and repair, Windows and Linux administration, network troubleshooting, endpoint lifecycle management, and deployment scripting. Lastly, I have solid skills in cybersecurity, SEO, and handling data securely.": "Gumagamit ako ng HTML at CSS para bumuo ng mga dynamic, user-friendly, at responsive na interface, at JavaScript para buhayin ang mga ito gamit ang mga interactive na feature. Bihasa ako sa Python at Java para sa data science at mga programang mabigat sa lohika. Gumagamit din ako ng Node.js, React, Angular, Vue.js, Figma, at WordPress. Sa infrastructure naman, hinahawakan ko ang pag-diagnose at pag-aayos ng hardware, pangangasiwa ng Windows at Linux, pag-troubleshoot ng network, pamamahala ng endpoint lifecycle, at deployment scripting. Panghuli, may matibay akong kasanayan sa cybersecurity, SEO, at ligtas na paghawak ng data.",
  "Expand my skills by experiencing how programming is used in the industry. Furthermore, I want to contribute to the company that has given me the opportunity to work for them by applying what I have been practicing and learning. Lastly, I want to be able to expand my network with other colleagues that I'll be able to work with.": "Palawakin ang aking mga kasanayan sa pamamagitan ng pagdanas kung paano ginagamit ang programming sa industriya. Bukod dito, nais kong makapag-ambag sa kumpanyang nagbigay sa akin ng pagkakataong magtrabaho para sa kanila sa pamamagitan ng paglalapat ng aking mga pinag-aralan at pinagsanayan. Panghuli, nais kong mapalawak ang aking network kasama ang iba pang mga kasamahang makakatrabaho ko.",
  "I enjoy developing systems, not just the frontend, I like developing systems as side projects. Furthermore, I work well in a team and enjoy leading other members, and all throughout the project time I'll try to get to know them. I also work well independently while listening to music to concentrate. Additionally, I can adapt quickly to systems that I'm required to learn. Lastly, I can visualize how data flows through a system before it's built.": "Gusto kong bumuo ng mga system, hindi lang frontend, at gusto kong gumawa ng mga system bilang side project. Bukod dito, mahusay akong makipagtulungan sa team at gusto kong pamunuan ang ibang miyembro, at sa buong panahon ng proyekto ay sinisikap kong makilala sila. Mahusay din akong magtrabaho nang mag-isa habang nakikinig ng musika para makapag-focus. Dagdag pa rito, mabilis akong makaangkop sa mga system na kailangan kong matutunan. Panghuli, kaya kong makita sa isip kung paano dadaloy ang data sa isang system bago pa ito mabuo.",
  "Currently, I'm specializing in Frontend Development, however, I am able to go full-stack with all my skills. I enjoy creating systems, not just the frontend, it also includes the design, backend, APIs, database, hosting, and server configuration.": "Sa kasalukuyan, nagpapakadalubhasa ako sa Frontend Development, ngunit kaya kong mag-full-stack gamit ang lahat ng aking kasanayan. Gusto kong lumikha ng mga system, hindi lang ang frontend, kasama rin ang disenyo, backend, APIs, database, hosting, at server configuration.",
