  "A blog and news platform where users can read and write articles to highlight social issues. Authored content is published publicly, allowing for discussion and awareness. Developed collaboratively with Elisha Gania, Karl Guiao, Kimberly Puno, and Shane Cordero.": "Isang blog at news platform kung saan makakabasa at makakasulat ang mga user ng mga artikulo para itampok ang mga isyung panlipunan. Inilalathala nang publiko ang mga isinulat na nilalaman, na nagbubukas ng talakayan at kamalayan. Binuo kasama sina Elisha Gania, Karl Guiao, Kimberly Puno, at Shane Cordero.",
  "A Web-based car rental platform with real-time vehicle availability, 24-hour maintenance buffer logic between rentals, robust architecture, user-friendly interface, and real-time update. This was developed collaboratively alongside De Jesus Franz Mark, Galang Redge, and Guiao Karl.": "Isang web-based na car rental platform na may real-time na availability ng sasakyan, 24-oras na maintenance buffer logic sa pagitan ng mga pag-upa, matibay na arkitektura, user-friendly na interface, at real-time na update. Binuo ito kasama sina De Jesus Franz Mark, Galang Redge, at Guiao Karl.",
  "An online perfume shop for men and women with product browsing, a shopping cart, and user accounts. Built in collaboration with Pangilinan Gabrielle, Gonzales John Patrick, Guiao Karl, De Jesus Mark.": "Isang online na tindahan ng pabango para sa lalaki at babae na may pag-browse ng produkto, shopping cart, at user account. Binuo kasama sina Pangilinan Gabrielle, Gonzales John Patrick, Guiao Karl, at De Jesus Mark.",
  "A Python-based finance management system that tracks personal income, expenses, and investments while generating reports. Designed and implemented collaboratively with Pangilinan Gabrielle, Venzon Mathew, Gonzales John Patrick.": "Isang finance management system na gawa sa Python na sumusubaybay sa personal na kita, gastos, at pamumuhunan habang gumagawa ng mga report. Idinisenyo at ipinatupad kasama sina Pangilinan Gabrielle, Venzon Mathew, at Gonzales John Patrick.",
