  "This project provides a comprehensive, web-based vehicle rental management system. Developed as a collaborative effort, the platform provides users with real-time tracking of vehicle availability, strict user verification mechanisms, and an integrated digital wallet simulation to handle financial transactions securely. Additionally, it implements automated business logic, including a 24-hour maintenance buffer, to ensure fleet availability and system reliability.": "Nagbibigay ang proyektong ito ng isang komprehensibo at web-based na vehicle rental management system. Binuo bilang isang pangkatang gawain, nagbibigay ang platform sa mga user ng real-time na pagsubaybay sa availability ng sasakyan, mahigpit na mekanismo ng pag-verify ng user, at integrated na digital wallet simulation para ligtas na mahawakan ang mga transaksyong pinansyal. Bukod dito, gumagamit ito ng automated business logic, kabilang ang 24-oras na maintenance buffer, para matiyak ang availability ng mga sasakyan at pagiging maaasahan ng system.",
  "• Real-time vehicle availability tracking and dynamic filtering.": "• Real-time na pagsubaybay sa availability ng sasakyan at dynamic na filtering.",
  "• Secure digital wallet simulation for user transactions.": "• Ligtas na digital wallet simulation para sa mga transaksyon ng user.",
  "• 24-hour buffer logic for routine vehicle maintenance.": "• 24-oras na buffer logic para sa regular na maintenance ng sasakyan.",
  "• Role-based administrative dashboard for verification and bookings.": "• Role-based na administrative dashboard para sa pag-verify at mga booking.",
  "Technologies used to structure and style the frontend interface": "Mga teknolohiyang ginamit sa istruktura at disenyo ng frontend interface",
  "Component-based frontend with real-time availability updates": "Component-based na frontend na may real-time na update ng availability",
  "Backend APIs, booking logic, and persistent NoSQL data storage": "Mga backend API, booking logic, at permanenteng NoSQL data storage",
  "Deployed using Netlify for the frontend and Render for the backend APIs": "Na-deploy gamit ang Netlify para sa frontend at Render para sa mga backend API",
