  "Managed the end-to-end endpoint lifecycle, conducting hardware assessment, cleaning, assembly, QA testing, and deployment for enterprise units.": "Pinamahalaan ang buong endpoint lifecycle, kabilang ang assessment, paglilinis, assembly, QA testing, at deployment ng mga enterprise unit.",
