  "Diagnosed and repaired faulty hardware and software units escalated from Tech Support and external departments.": "Nag-diagnose at nag-ayos ng mga sirang hardware at software unit na ipinasa mula sa Tech Support at ibang departamento.",
  "Spearheaded a team of interns to deliver core supervisor-led projects, optimizing workflows to meet key project deadlines.": "Pinangunahan ang isang team ng mga intern sa pagtapos ng mahahalagang proyektong pinangunahan ng supervisor, at pinahusay ang mga workflow para maabot ang mga deadline.",
  "Provided direct operational support to engineering supervisors by troubleshooting issues and executing high-priority technical assignments.": "Nagbigay ng direktang suporta sa mga engineering supervisor sa pamamagitan ng pag-troubleshoot ng mga isyu at paggawa ng mga teknikal na gawaing may mataas na prayoridad.",
  "Foundational IT certification covering basic IT concepts, hardware, software, networking, security, and troubleshooting.": "Pangunahing IT certification na sumasaklaw sa mga batayang konsepto ng IT, hardware, software, networking, security, at troubleshooting.",
  "Covers HTML5, CSS3, Flexbox, CSS Grid, responsive web design, accessibility, and applied projects including a portfolio site.": "Sumasaklaw sa HTML5, CSS3, Flexbox, CSS Grid, responsive web design, accessibility, at mga praktikal na proyekto kabilang ang isang portfolio site.",
  "Comprehensive program teaching user-centered design, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, Figma workflows, and creating high-fidelity mockups.": "Komprehensibong programang nagtuturo ng user-centered design, wireframing, prototyping, usability testing, Figma workflow, at paggawa ng high-fidelity na mockup.",
  "Focuses on PostgreSQL, database design, CRUD operations, joins, normalization, Bash scripting, and building real database-backed projects.": "Nakatuon sa PostgreSQL, disenyo ng database, CRUD operations, joins, normalization, Bash scripting, at pagbuo ng mga totoong proyektong may database.",
  "Extensive training for core JavaScript: algorithms, data structures (arrays, objects, maps, sets), OOP, functional programming, and solving numerous coding challenges.": "Malawak na pagsasanay sa core JavaScript: algorithms, data structures (arrays, objects, maps, sets), OOP, functional programming, at paglutas ng maraming coding challenge.",
