 "html": {
  "6<sup>th</sup> <small>of 16</small>": "Ika-6 <small>sa 16</small>",
  "6<sup>th</sup> <small>of 14</small>": "Ika-6 <small>sa 14</small>",
  "WordPress website that promotes a coffee shop named Huan Coffee. This will be used by the business online through hosting and using a server to hold and maintain the website, this can be visited by searching <a href=\"https://huancoffee.shop/\" class=\"titleLink huanCoffeeLink\" target=\"_blank\">huancoffee.shop</a>. Developed collaboratively with De Jesus Franz Mark, Galang Redge, Guiao Karl.": "WordPress website na nagpo-promote sa isang coffee shop na Huan Coffee. Gagamitin ito ng negosyo online sa pamamagitan ng hosting at isang server na nag-iimbak at nagpapanatili ng website. Mabibisita ito sa paghahanap ng <a href=\"https://huancoffee.shop/\" class=\"titleLink huanCoffeeLink\" target=\"_blank\">huancoffee.shop</a>. Binuo kasama sina De Jesus Franz Mark, Galang Redge, at Guiao Karl.",
  "On the surface, AI seems to be advancing at breakneck speed. Every week, a new model claims higher benchmarks. However, we are reaching a \"data wall.\" AI learns from human data—but as AI-generated content floods the web, AI is beginning to learn from itself. This creates a feedback loop that could lead to <strong>Model Collapse</strong>.": "Sa unang tingin, mukhang napakabilis ng pag-unlad ng AI. Bawat linggo, may bagong modelong nagsasabing mas mataas ang benchmark nito. Gayunpaman, papalapit na tayo sa isang \"data wall.\" Natututo ang AI mula sa data ng tao—ngunit habang bumabaha sa web ang nilalamang gawa ng AI, nagsisimula nang matuto ang AI mula sa sarili nito. Lumilikha ito ng feedback loop na maaaring humantong sa <strong>Model Collapse</strong>.",
  "In the best-case scenario, AI is a power multiplier. It handles repetitive tasks—like setting up your specific <strong>Light Mode</strong> variables—allowing you to focus on the creative architecture of the site.": "Sa pinakamagandang sitwasyon, ang AI ay nagpaparami ng kakayahan. Hinahawakan nito ang mga paulit-ulit na gawain—tulad ng pag-set up ng iyong mga variable para sa <strong>Light Mode</strong>—para makapag-focus ka sa malikhaing arkitektura ng site.",
  "The danger lies in efficiency at the cost of agency. If we stop understanding <em>why</em> a certain layout property was used and simply trust the output, we become \"The Prompt Engineer\" rather than the Developer.": "Ang panganib ay nasa kahusayang kapalit ng sariling pagpapasya. Kung titigil tayong unawain <em>kung bakit</em> ginamit ang isang layout property at basta na lang pagkakatiwalaan ang output, nagiging \"Prompt Engineer\" na lang tayo sa halip na Developer.",
  "In building this portfolio, I've found that the human must remain the <strong>System Architect</strong>. AI is incredible for execution but poor for intent. We must use AI to automate the known, so we have the mental bandwidth to explore the unknown.": "Sa pagbuo ng portfolio na ito, natuklasan kong ang tao ang dapat manatiling <strong>System Architect</strong>. Napakahusay ng AI sa pagpapatupad pero mahina sa layunin. Dapat nating gamitin ang AI para i-automate ang alam na, para may sapat tayong isip na tuklasin ang hindi pa alam.",
  "The risk of assisted programming is the illusion of competence. Traditional programming forced a deep understanding because if you didn't understand the code, you couldn't write it. Now, you can generate code you don't understand. Our job in 2026 is to remain the <strong>Final Authority</strong>.": "Ang panganib ng assisted programming ay ang ilusyon ng kakayahan. Sa tradisyonal na programming, napipilitan tayong umunawa nang malalim dahil kung hindi mo naiintindihan ang code, hindi mo ito maisusulat. Ngayon, makakagawa ka ng code na hindi mo naiintindihan. Ang trabaho natin sa 2026 ay manatiling <strong>Huling Awtoridad</strong>.",
  "As I state in my bio, we must thrive to look for solutions ourselves. Whether you are a writer or a coder, the \"heavy lifting\" is where the growth happens. AI should be a <strong>consultant</strong>, not the <strong>decision-maker</strong>. To combat dependency, we must intentionally practice \"analog\" problem-solving—mapping out systems before the AI has a chance to intervene.": "Gaya ng sinabi ko sa aking bio, dapat nating sikaping hanapin ang mga solusyon nang sarili. Manunulat ka man o coder, sa \"mabigat na trabaho\" nangyayari ang paglago. Ang AI ay dapat maging <strong>tagapayo</strong>, hindi ang <strong>tagapagpasya</strong>. Para labanan ang pag-asa, dapat nating sadyang sanayin ang \"analog\" na paglutas ng problema—ang pagplano ng mga system bago pa makialam ang AI."
 },
